# prompt: heavy wooden door slamming shut
# tags: door, slam, close, wood
# Two wooden resonators rather than one: the leaf at 160 Hz with a very low Q,
# and the frame at 420 Hz ringing 20 ms later because the door reaches it
# second. `door-creak` is the other half of the same door — this is the one a
# game actually needs twenty times a level.
sound "door slam" 800ms impact
  crack: noise white >> bp ~1800Hz[800..4000] Q2 | gain 0.24 attack 0ms decay 50ms
  leaf: modal wood ~160Hz[80..340] Q14 | gain 0.38 decay 300ms
  thump: sub ~70Hz[35..130] -> 45Hz in 90ms | gain 0.34 attack 3ms decay 300ms
  frame: modal wood ~420Hz[200..900] Q30 | gain 0.14 decay 260ms delay 20ms
  room: noise pink >> lp ~1400Hz[600..3200] >> verb 300ms mix 0.35 | gain 0.09 decay 220ms delay 40ms
